      m_Calls: []
  m_text: You are given a gun which can kill enemies quickly, but is limited in ammo.
    Try to find ammo scattered around along with health packs! Youll find them mostly
    on tables, so be sure to explore the levels to find them! You will also be given
    a melee weapon, a bat that you can swing infinitely, but deals significantly
    less damage. You can also move through levels while sprinting, which will come
    in handy if enemies start getting too intense!
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
