  m_text: Watch out for traps! There are three traps/environmental dangers you need
    to look out for! The first is a bear trap, which keeps you in place for a few
    seconds. The next one is the glass trap which gives you damage whenever you walk
    on it. The last is broken floorboards, weak floorboards that if you step on them,
    you will fall through and die!
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
